01:41.410 --> 01:43.580
And so...

01:43.580 --> 01:50.960
The mass of a star can be considered equivalent to the quantity of fuel it contains.

01:51.340 --> 01:57.050
In short, the star's lifespan is proportional to its mass.

01:57.050 --> 02:02.010
The star's intensity is dependent on
the percentage of its fuel it's consumed.

02:02.010 --> 02:03.140
Put another way...

02:03.140 --> 02:05.520
My name is Asami.

02:05.520 --> 02:08.140
I'm a 17-year-old high school girl.

02:08.940 --> 02:12.820
I keep it secret from everyone, but...

02:15.070 --> 02:17.030
I'm actually married.

02:18.070 --> 02:22.990
It's a Secret to Everybody, But...

02:23.910 --> 02:29.870
My husband, Ichimaru Kyousuke-sensei,
teaches physics at my school.

02:30.170 --> 02:31.710
Here you are, Darling.

02:33.290 --> 02:34.340
Thank you.

02:34.340 --> 02:37.590
Eat it all up, okay?

02:39.470 --> 02:42.680
What time will you be
getting home today, Darling?

02:42.680 --> 02:44.930
Huh? Should be the usual time...

02:44.930 --> 02:46.180
So you'll be early?

02:46.180 --> 02:47.930
Bye.

02:55.860 --> 02:57.860
Okay then, I'll be going.

03:03.410 --> 03:07.040
Even though we are a married couple,

03:07.040 --> 03:10.620
we have never... That is to say...

03:11.080 --> 03:13.330
We haven't ever...

03:14.290 --> 03:18.710
Does my husband think I'm still just a child?

03:18.710 --> 03:22.640
Hey, Asami... have you told him you like him?

03:22.640 --> 03:23.300
Huh?

03:23.300 --> 03:25.810
Don't you have a thing for Ichimaru-sensei?

03:25.810 --> 03:28.060
What? I don't have anything "for" him.

03:28.060 --> 03:29.850
It's written all over your face.

03:29.850 --> 03:30.940
Right?

03:30.940 --> 03:31.560
Yeah.

03:31.560 --> 03:33.150
Not you too, Kasumi.

03:33.150 --> 03:36.400
If you keep hesitating,
somebody else will steal him away.

03:36.400 --> 03:38.480
I-It isn't like that!

03:38.480 --> 03:40.070
So how <i>is</i> it?

03:40.070 --> 03:42.610
Not like that, that's for sure.

03:42.610 --> 03:44.780
You three, back there.

03:45.370 --> 03:47.120
Please keep quiet.

03:47.660 --> 03:49.790
You're disrupting the lesson.

03:49.790 --> 03:52.080
S-Sorry.

03:50.790 --> 03:52.080
Sorry.

03:52.080 --> 03:54.330
See? We got told off.

03:54.330 --> 03:57.170
You're a real handful, you know that?

04:00.800 --> 04:04.090
Ichimaru-sensei, what do you say to
a drinking session tonight?

04:04.090 --> 04:06.180
No, it's okay, I...

04:06.180 --> 04:10.390
Come on, it won't kill you to go out once in a while.

04:10.390 --> 04:14.020
Hey, Iwasaki-sensei, you have to come too!

04:14.020 --> 04:17.400
Young guns like us have to
blow off some steam.

04:17.400 --> 04:21.320
Sorry, Sonoda-sensei, I already have plans...

04:22.030 --> 04:24.160
Maybe some other time.

04:24.160 --> 04:27.160
No problem, don't worry about it.

04:27.160 --> 04:28.330
I'm sorry.

04:34.830 --> 04:37.420
Looks like we can just do whatever, then.

04:38.670 --> 04:44.050
I get it. Sonoda-sensei likes Iwasaki-sensei "that way."

04:44.050 --> 04:44.970
Sensei!

04:46.720 --> 04:47.890
Here you go.

04:47.890 --> 04:50.390
Asami asked me to deliver this to you.

04:50.390 --> 04:53.850
From Asa- ...you mean, Onohara?

04:54.560 --> 04:56.310
Are you happy?

04:56.310 --> 04:58.060
If I'm <i>allowed</i> to be...

04:58.060 --> 05:00.980
Good. Be seeing you!

05:03.900 --> 05:05.990
What were you thinking, Asami?

05:05.990 --> 05:08.950
We can't let people find out
about our marriage.

05:08.950 --> 05:11.620
So we'd decided not to bring lunches...

05:12.410 --> 05:13.700
But since it's here...

05:16.830 --> 05:18.540
What? Lunch?

05:18.540 --> 05:22.260
I made it for my boyfriend,
but he didn't show up today.

05:22.260 --> 05:24.550
Don't do random stuff like that.

05:24.550 --> 05:28.300
Well, Ichimaru-sensei didn't seem like he hated it.

05:28.300 --> 05:29.760
But, I...

05:29.760 --> 05:30.640
Don't you get it?

05:30.640 --> 05:35.350
Guys have only one thing on their mind 24 hours a day: girls.

05:35.350 --> 05:37.350
S-Satomi.

05:37.350 --> 05:39.650
My boyfriend's the same way.

05:39.650 --> 05:42.860
S-Sensei isn't like that at all!

05:44.940 --> 05:49.240
Oh, that's right. I have something that I need to do.

05:49.240 --> 05:52.620
Jeez, Satomi, what was the point in saying all that stuff?

05:50.990 --> 05:53.240
Hey hey, hey hey.

05:52.620 --> 05:55.910
And it'd be so bad if they
found out we were marr-

05:54.250 --> 05:55.910
Hey, Asami.

05:58.080 --> 05:59.830
Darling?

06:00.330 --> 06:02.090
Is that right?

06:02.090 --> 06:04.010
I thought it seemed weird.

06:04.010 --> 06:05.720
Sorry.

06:05.720 --> 06:07.130
Darling?

06:07.130 --> 06:07.680
Eh?

06:07.680 --> 06:11.720
You'll get home early tonight, won't you?

06:12.510 --> 06:13.810
Yeah...

06:14.930 --> 06:15.980
Yeah.

06:19.400 --> 06:22.730
Today is a very special day
that only happens once a year.

06:22.730 --> 06:24.360
Asami!

06:25.440 --> 06:27.610
We've got club activities!

06:27.610 --> 06:29.570
Sorry, I'm not going today.

06:29.570 --> 06:30.700
Again?

06:31.120 --> 06:34.700
There is a birthday today...

06:35.910 --> 06:37.160
Whose?

06:37.160 --> 06:40.040
Huh? Oh, umm... my father's.

06:41.630 --> 06:43.000
Your father's?

06:43.920 --> 06:45.630
Bye.

06:46.210 --> 06:51.390
I'm sure she said her
father's birthday was last month.

06:52.720 --> 06:56.180
Today is my husband's birthday.

06:56.180 --> 06:59.190
"How to make Meat & Potato Stew"

06:56.770 --> 06:59.190
I do hope you'll enjoy

06:59.190 --> 07:02.770
my lovingly-cooked
homemade meal, Darling.

07:04.980 --> 07:06.320
I'm home.

07:07.490 --> 07:10.240
W-What a massive selection.

07:10.240 --> 07:12.910
Thank you very much, Asami.
I'm so impressed!

07:15.160 --> 07:17.370
I love you, Asami.

07:18.250 --> 07:22.630
I've always been waiting for this day, Darling.

07:23.960 --> 07:25.500
Darling...!

07:29.340 --> 07:31.840
M-Maybe not.

07:34.470 --> 07:35.850
Darling?

07:35.850 --> 07:37.600
I'm just leaving school now.

07:38.020 --> 07:41.100
Okay then. Please be careful.

07:42.480 --> 07:45.360
Right! I'll do my very best!

07:46.320 --> 07:47.570
"Applied Homemade Cooking"

07:54.490 --> 07:57.490
Good, I'm nearly done.

07:57.490 --> 08:01.410
I'm sure you'll enjoy it, won't you?

08:01.410 --> 08:03.460
Time's a wasting.

08:11.920 --> 08:13.130
I'm home.

08:16.300 --> 08:18.930
What on Earth happened?

08:20.350 --> 08:21.890
I'm so sorry.

08:23.940 --> 08:25.190
Asami?

08:26.360 --> 08:28.520
I-I...

08:30.860 --> 08:33.490
Because today's your birthday,

08:33.490 --> 08:38.280
"How to make Meat & Potato Stew"

08:34.030 --> 08:38.280
I tried to cook you a delicious feast.

08:38.280 --> 08:40.580
But this is all that survived intact.

08:43.580 --> 08:45.420
I'm happy, Asami.

08:47.210 --> 08:49.750
You remembered my birthday.

08:49.750 --> 08:54.300
And, you were always thinking of me.

08:55.260 --> 08:57.010
Darling...

08:58.180 --> 09:00.720
Let me see what it tastes like.

09:04.140 --> 09:05.730
It's delicious.

09:05.730 --> 09:08.900
R-Really?!

09:08.900 --> 09:10.690
Yes, it tastes good.

09:12.570 --> 09:13.990
I'm so glad.

09:13.990 --> 09:17.700
It was quite a warm day,
so I'll be taking a bath now.

09:17.700 --> 09:19.450
It's going to be a long night.

09:19.450 --> 09:23.200
"It's going to be a long night," he says...

09:25.830 --> 09:27.000
Okay.

09:28.460 --> 09:30.590
This is fantastic.

09:30.590 --> 09:32.000
Darling?

09:34.050 --> 09:37.010
D-Do you mind if I come in too?

09:38.890 --> 09:42.770
Umm... No, but...

09:42.770 --> 09:44.140
A-Asami!

09:44.770 --> 09:46.560
Hey there!

09:47.770 --> 09:49.980
F-Father!?

09:49.980 --> 09:53.230
What the hell do you think you're doing?
You damn pervy teacher!

09:54.110 --> 09:57.280
You're always showing up
with zero warning, Father.

09:57.280 --> 10:02.740
<b>Contract - Onohara Iwao
We, Ichimaru Kyousuke and Asami, concurrent with our family registration, do hereby agree to the following terms:
1) I, Ichimaru Kyousuke, do swear to refrain from, for any and all reasons, engaging in male-female relations with my wife, Asami, until she graduates from high school.
2) I, Ichimaru Asami, do swear to refrain from, for any and all reasons, engaging in male-female relations with my husband, Kyousuke, until I graduate from high school.</b>

09:57.280 --> 09:59.780
Read the contract and weep.

09:59.780 --> 10:02.740
I-I'm still honoring the deal.

10:03.870 --> 10:05.660
L-Look here...

10:05.660 --> 10:06.790
What now!?

10:06.790 --> 10:08.540
Y-You see...

10:08.540 --> 10:10.920
Listen to me, you sick pervert teacher.

10:10.920 --> 10:14.000
It's not like I've accepted you yet.

10:16.340 --> 10:18.260
And you should be ashamed, Asami.

10:18.260 --> 10:21.510
For throwing together such a feast
for such a lowlife.

10:21.510 --> 10:23.890
Hey-

10:22.260 --> 10:23.890
Oh, this isn't half bad.

10:26.890 --> 10:28.890
T-This is mine.

10:31.480 --> 10:32.730
Say WHAT?!?

10:33.980 --> 10:36.400
F-Father.

10:38.860 --> 10:41.280
D-Darling?

10:46.450 --> 10:48.210
Now you listen to me!

10:49.120 --> 10:50.830
This food is...

10:52.210 --> 10:56.010
It's what Asami cooked while thinking of me.

10:56.010 --> 11:00.010
Whether you accept me or not,
Asami married me, and that's that.

11:00.010 --> 11:02.220
Asami belongs to me!

11:03.510 --> 11:04.680
Darling...

11:06.140 --> 11:10.140
She might have married you,
but I can't give her away so easily.

11:10.140 --> 11:12.350
Which means that-!

11:12.350 --> 11:13.560
What!?

11:13.560 --> 11:18.400
Oh, Darling, your alcohol tolerance is <i>not</i> that high.

11:19.240 --> 11:20.820
Asami is...

11:28.200 --> 11:30.040
D-Darling!

11:30.040 --> 11:34.250
What, a couple beers knocks you out cold?
I'm outta here!

11:34.250 --> 11:35.920
Darling, Darling...

11:36.460 --> 11:38.050
Darling?

11:46.430 --> 11:49.310
I love you. I love you so much.

11:50.230 --> 11:54.360
I hoped that today was the day,
but it wasn't meant to be.

11:54.360 --> 11:58.440
But please, love me lots from now on.

11:58.440 --> 12:00.940
A whole lot.

12:10.000 --> 12:11.910
My name is Asami.

12:11.910 --> 12:14.120
I'm a 17-year-old high school girl.

12:14.710 --> 12:18.500
I keep it secret from everyone, but...

12:18.500 --> 12:20.420
I'm actually married.

12:21.420 --> 12:23.550
I should probably wake him.

12:24.050 --> 12:25.300
Darling!

12:25.300 --> 12:28.010
Darling, it's time to wake up.

12:28.010 --> 12:33.810
My husband, Ichimaru Kyousuke-sensei,
teaches physics at my school.

12:35.020 --> 12:36.770
Okay. Good morning.

12:37.310 --> 12:39.270
Your breakfast is ready.

12:40.570 --> 12:45.490
I Got a Love Letter!

12:45.570 --> 12:49.200
What? You aren't eating anything?

12:49.200 --> 12:53.830
I totally forgot that I need to get in early today.

12:53.830 --> 12:55.960
I have to get ready for the faculty meeting.

12:55.960 --> 12:59.380
Darling, what time will you be home?

12:59.380 --> 13:01.670
If I get held up, I'll give you a call.

13:02.590 --> 13:03.760
B-Bye then...

13:03.760 --> 13:05.510
I'm off.

13:09.010 --> 13:12.730
Even though we are a married couple,
we still haven't...

13:14.310 --> 13:16.440
...done "it," not even once.

13:16.440 --> 13:21.320
But I'll make<i> him be affectionate with me today.</i>

13:28.200 --> 13:29.200
Onohara
Asami

13:45.420 --> 13:48.840
Asami-sama,
The first time I laid eyes on you,
I thought you were so lovely. Would you
mind meeting me and having a chat?
I'll be waiting at the main gates after school.

13:49.800 --> 13:51.560
This is... a love letter.

13:55.560 --> 13:57.140
Good morning.

14:00.110 --> 14:03.480
Okay, please open your books to page 28.

14:04.570 --> 14:07.610
Today, we'll continue from
where we left off yesterday.

14:08.320 --> 14:13.080
The universe began 15 billion years ago,
and formed from nothing.

14:10.570 --> 14:14.080
Asami-sama,
The first time I laid eyes on you,
I thought you were so lovely. Would you
mind meeting me and having a chat?
I'll be waiting at the main gates after school.

14:15.370 --> 14:17.120
What're you looking at?

14:18.080 --> 14:20.670
Whoa, isn't this a love letter?!

14:20.670 --> 14:22.290
A love letter?

14:22.290 --> 14:23.300
N-No!

14:28.220 --> 14:29.970
Hey, I said give it back.

14:29.970 --> 14:33.510
Ooh... "I'll be waiting at
the main gates after school."

14:33.510 --> 14:34.970
Give it back!

14:34.970 --> 14:38.390
Say, who's it from?
No name, no signature, no nothing.

14:38.390 --> 14:40.100
Does it really matter? Give it back!

14:40.440 --> 14:43.940
If you want to take it back, I'll take you on any time!

14:49.360 --> 14:53.620
Don't be reading love letters in my class.
Focus on the lesson.

14:54.080 --> 14:55.160
Here.

15:00.670 --> 15:02.210
Oh, umm-

15:01.580 --> 15:06.300
So, does anybody have any questions?

15:07.170 --> 15:09.680
That wasn't nice, Satomi.

15:09.680 --> 15:13.720
Sorry, sorry. But you were happy,
weren't you?

15:13.720 --> 15:14.760
Not at all.

15:14.760 --> 15:16.220
Don't lie.

15:15.560 --> 15:17.180
I'm not lying.

15:17.180 --> 15:21.690
We'll see about that.
What if it's from a really cool guy?

15:21.690 --> 15:24.150
You haven't thought this through, Satomi.

15:24.150 --> 15:25.360
Eh? What'd I miss?

15:25.360 --> 15:30.450
What you <i>missed</i> is that she did all that
in front of Ichimaru-sensei.

15:33.530 --> 15:35.330
It's hard work, isn't it?

15:35.330 --> 15:38.160
Somebody's got to do it,
and my number's come up.

15:38.160 --> 15:39.710
I'll help you.

15:40.370 --> 15:42.330
Ichimaru-sensei.

15:42.330 --> 15:43.540
Me too, me too.

15:43.540 --> 15:46.750
Iwasaki-sensei, please let me
help you guys too~!

15:46.750 --> 15:49.340
Oh, then you...

15:51.800 --> 15:52.760
Asami.

15:54.720 --> 15:56.850
Are you passing on
club activities again today?

15:58.560 --> 15:59.600
Yeah...

16:01.310 --> 16:02.810
Well, you know-

16:02.310 --> 16:03.520
I'm sorry.

16:05.980 --> 16:08.230
Please apologize to the others for me.

16:08.230 --> 16:09.480
Okay.

16:09.480 --> 16:10.440
See you.

16:10.440 --> 16:11.740
Asami!

16:11.740 --> 16:13.410
Wait, Asami!

16:13.410 --> 16:15.620
Hey, where are you two going?

16:15.620 --> 16:17.830
I'm going home through the back way.

16:17.830 --> 16:20.040
What!? You aren't going to meet him!?

16:20.040 --> 16:22.330
Aren't you even wondering what he's like?!

16:22.330 --> 16:24.080
You still don't get it.

16:24.080 --> 16:27.670
Come on, we can at least see what kind of boy he is.

16:27.670 --> 16:29.210
No, I don't want to.

16:29.210 --> 16:31.630
Then I'll have to check him out
in your place.

16:32.630 --> 16:35.390
I'll give you a full report later.

16:41.560 --> 16:42.850
Asami!?

16:42.850 --> 16:45.480
Are you all right, Asami!?

16:45.480 --> 16:48.520
It hurts! I'm dying!

16:49.230 --> 16:51.530
I sure hope this meeting wraps up early.

16:51.940 --> 16:54.030
They always take too long.

16:58.950 --> 17:00.990
Asami! Hey!

17:01.950 --> 17:03.210
Darling?!

17:03.210 --> 17:07.250
W-What's the matter, Asa-
...I mean,Onohara?

17:07.250 --> 17:11.630
She suddenly felt ill.
We're taking her to the nurse.

17:11.630 --> 17:13.470
Are you all right?

17:13.470 --> 17:15.630
Y-Yes, I'm fine.

17:16.090 --> 17:18.260
It's nothing major.

17:22.390 --> 17:24.230
Get on.

17:24.230 --> 17:26.940
I-I really am okay.

17:26.940 --> 17:29.400
I don't mind. Now, get on.

17:31.780 --> 17:33.320
Darling...

17:36.030 --> 17:37.030
Sure.

17:42.240 --> 17:43.750
Nurse's Office

17:44.120 --> 17:46.420
You don't have a fever.

17:46.420 --> 17:49.920
Do you have chest pains? Stomach pains?

17:49.920 --> 17:51.550
Do you feel dizzy?

17:52.000 --> 17:54.090
No, umm...

17:54.840 --> 17:56.430
E-Everything.

17:56.430 --> 17:57.260
Huh?

17:57.260 --> 18:01.010
I'm so sorry, Darling.

18:01.010 --> 18:04.930
Wow, you sure are kind, Ichimaru-sensei!

18:05.390 --> 18:08.190
Or maybe Asami's just special to you?

18:08.190 --> 18:10.310
W-What? What do you mean?

18:10.310 --> 18:11.400
Darn it, Satomi...

18:11.770 --> 18:15.320
Oooh, you're getting flustered!
Very suspicious.

18:15.320 --> 18:19.660
C-C'mon, it's only natural to worry about one of my students.

18:19.660 --> 18:23.410
At any rate, call me if you feel worse.

18:30.130 --> 18:31.710
I'll leave her with you.

18:31.710 --> 18:33.340
Okay.

18:34.760 --> 18:36.470
Darling...

18:36.470 --> 18:38.180
Way to go, Asami!

18:38.510 --> 18:42.100
Ichimaru-sensei was way more than "normal-worried" about you.

18:42.100 --> 18:42.680
Right?

18:42.680 --> 18:44.010
Y-Yeah.

18:44.010 --> 18:45.640
He's got his eye on you for sure!

18:45.640 --> 18:47.430
That isn't true!

18:47.430 --> 18:49.940
How the heck can it <i>not</i> be true?

18:49.940 --> 18:53.980
That's umm... like...

18:54.480 --> 18:57.440
Oh, the paaaaain! *Dies*

18:57.440 --> 18:59.490
A-Asami!

18:57.990 --> 18:59.490
Are you all right!?

18:59.490 --> 19:01.280
Get off, will you!

19:00.110 --> 19:02.030
Oh, sorry!

19:01.280 --> 19:04.330
I made my husband worry about me, but...

19:04.330 --> 19:07.250
My fake illness trick did the job.

19:09.250 --> 19:13.750
I'm sorry. I don't know you who you are,

19:13.750 --> 19:16.670
but I only have feelings for my husband.

19:17.670 --> 19:20.510
My beloved husband.

19:29.770 --> 19:31.520
I'm so sorry...

19:35.770 --> 19:37.980
Do you feel better now?

19:38.490 --> 19:40.820
I'm fine, I'm fine.

19:40.820 --> 19:42.070
Are you sure?

19:42.070 --> 19:45.830
Yes. I'm really sorry I made you worry.

19:46.950 --> 19:48.910
I'll be home soon, anyway.

19:48.910 --> 19:50.500
Okay!

19:56.460 --> 19:57.630
Asami...

19:57.630 --> 20:00.550
Welcome back. I'm here to pick you up.

20:01.800 --> 20:03.550
Are you really okay?

20:03.840 --> 20:04.850
Yeah.

20:07.720 --> 20:08.970
As you can plainly see.

20:14.480 --> 20:15.900
Darling?

20:17.320 --> 20:18.860
I'm sorry.

20:18.860 --> 20:22.820
You had to go through awful things today,
all because of me.

20:22.820 --> 20:24.450
Huh? What're you talking about?

20:25.660 --> 20:26.910
The love letter.

20:26.910 --> 20:30.500
Oh, there's no need to worry about that.

20:30.500 --> 20:32.370
T-There isn't?

20:32.370 --> 20:34.250
Actually, it made me happy.

20:34.250 --> 20:34.880
Huh?

20:36.540 --> 20:40.210
It's guy logic. The fact that
you got a love letter

20:40.210 --> 20:44.760
only serves to prove...
how attractive my wife is.

20:44.760 --> 20:46.180
Darling...

20:46.800 --> 20:51.060
No matter what happens,
I'll always trust you.

20:51.680 --> 20:56.440
Because you're the one I love more than anyone else in the world.

20:59.070 --> 21:00.650
Darling.

21:09.990 --> 21:11.700
Well, today...

21:13.330 --> 21:16.500
I tried to wring some affection out of him, but...

21:29.050 --> 21:30.560
Darling?

21:30.560 --> 21:31.350
Huh?

21:31.850 --> 21:35.230
Sorry, would you mind heading to bed first?

21:35.230 --> 21:37.900
I just want to read till I reach
a stopping place.

21:39.690 --> 21:40.820
Sure.

21:42.280 --> 21:43.530
It's fine this way.

21:43.940 --> 21:48.570
Because I know we both
love and trust each other.

21:50.030 --> 21:54.700
I felt my husband's loving and generous heart for myself.

21:54.700 --> 21:58.880
And that alone makes me
happier than anything else.

22:15.980 --> 22:19.480
All I am is a kitten

22:15.980 --> 22:19.480
watashi wa koneko

22:19.480 --> 22:23.400
All for you, and yours alone

22:19.480 --> 22:23.400
anata hitori dake no

22:23.400 --> 22:30.280
A naive little kitten; I want you to raise me right.

22:23.400 --> 22:30.280
mijuku na koneko sodatete hoshii no

22:30.820 --> 22:34.330
Can't you grant me this simple wish for anything

22:30.820 --> 22:34.330
nozomareru koto no subete ni

22:34.330 --> 22:38.500
and every last thing that I desire?

22:34.330 --> 22:38.500
kotaete yukeru kana

22:38.500 --> 22:41.920
If you stare at me with those longing, hungry eyes,

22:38.500 --> 22:41.920
nagai me de mitete kuretara

22:41.920 --> 22:47.840
I'll make this scene hotter and hotter just for you

22:41.920 --> 22:47.840
dokidoki sasete itte ageru

22:47.840 --> 22:55.220
Your kisses are like love vitamins,
so give me more and more of them.

22:47.840 --> 22:55.220
ai no bitamin kiss motto choudai

22:55.220 --> 23:02.150
Wrapped inside your loving arms so tight,
I can sleep again tonight.

22:55.220 --> 23:02.150
itoshii ude no naka kyou mo nemuru no

23:02.770 --> 23:12.280
Forever and ever only yours; just a kitten of love.

23:02.770 --> 23:12.280
zutto anata dake no ai no koneko

23:29.010 --> 23:44.940
Preview

23:29.550 --> 23:31.260
Asami here.

23:31.260 --> 23:35.430
I've heard that guys like "stimulating" clothing.

23:35.430 --> 23:39.180
Right then, I'll don a daring outfit
and go on the offensive!

23:39.180 --> 23:40.270
"Café"

23:39.180 --> 23:43.400
So please, love me lots next week too.
